#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:1 59d5e487b2414c97bfebe997eb3d7322
msgid "训练器架构"
msgstr "Trainer architecture"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:3 1b15b87a794f4b0a950be95a23c0ca90
msgid ""
"深入理解 UniKT 训练器系统的内部架构：BaseTrainer 的链式构建器、前向传播规范、数据对齐机制，以及 MultiTrainer "
"的多阶段训练编排。"
msgstr ""
"A deep dive into the internals of UniKT's trainer system: BaseTrainer's "
"chained builder, forward pass conventions, data alignment mechanisms, and "
"MultiTrainer's multi-stage training orchestration."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:5 3f4da26579f544beb7573bc196cc8e58
msgid "架构概览"
msgstr "Architecture overview"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:18 6f154e74ebda4a2792f7c69d3a371c44
msgid "UniKT 提供两条训练路径："
msgstr "UniKT provides two training paths:"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:20 22a7c4083ce746c5b10f93a609ddd643
msgid ""
"**BaseTrainer**：单阶段训练器，通过链式构建器（Builder Pattern）装配模型、数据、优化器和实验管理，然后执行标准的 "
"train/val/test 循环。"
msgstr ""
"**BaseTrainer**: a single-stage trainer that assembles the model, data, "
"optimizer, and experiment management via a chained builder (Builder Pattern), "
"then runs the standard train/val/test loop."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:21 1c802e71bc694d39bc7fd3070bff78c1
msgid ""
"**MultiTrainer**：多阶段训练器，继承 "
"BaseTrainer，将训练拆分为多个顺序阶段，每个阶段可拥有独立的模型组件、数据和早停策略。"
msgstr ""
"**MultiTrainer**: a multi-stage trainer that extends BaseTrainer and splits "
"training into sequential stages, each with its own model components, data, "
"and early stopping strategy."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:23 79c85e2dc96f480896566217cc630f56
msgid "BaseTrainer 链式构建器"
msgstr "BaseTrainer chained builder"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:25 174d127443c54755a5612c553e3bf765
msgid ""
"BaseTrainer 的设计遵循 **链式构建器（Fluent Builder）** 模式：通过一组 ``with_*`` "
"方法配置训练器的各个维度，最后调用 ``build`` 完成初始化，``run`` 执行训练。"
msgstr ""
"BaseTrainer follows the **Fluent Builder** pattern: configure each dimension "
"of the trainer via a set of ``with_*`` methods, then call ``build`` to "
"finalize initialization and ``run`` to execute training."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:27 d798c7aa983a4b20994f4c86f474e607
msgid "完整调用链"
msgstr "Full call chain"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:44 7a3159ed511341cbbab38f5ab1e31445
msgid "with_training —— 训练参数"
msgstr "with_training — Training parameters"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:56 cd4cf3b31f59446092c1ff3366fddd5c
msgid "创建 ``TrainingConfig`` dataclass 实例，指定训练轮数、随机种子、计算设备和断点续训路径。"
msgstr ""
"Creates a ``TrainingConfig`` dataclass instance specifying the number of "
"epochs, random seed, compute device, and checkpoint resume path."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:58 24ff7724457640888de449338021e432
msgid "``device=None`` 时，``build`` 阶段自动调用 ``_try_gpu`` 检测可用 GPU，无 GPU 则回退到 CPU。"
msgstr ""
"When ``device=None``, the ``build`` phase automatically calls ``_try_gpu`` to "
"detect an available GPU, falling back to CPU if none is found."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:59 6947d0fb70104214a43c32fda62bd1d5
msgid ""
"``checkpoint_path`` 不为空时，``build`` 会加载检查点并恢复 epoch、optimizer、lr_scheduler"
" 和 early_stopping 状态，从 ``start_epoch`` 继续训练。"
msgstr ""
"When ``checkpoint_path`` is not empty, ``build`` loads the checkpoint and "
"restores the epoch, optimizer, lr_scheduler, and early_stopping state, "
"resuming training from ``start_epoch``."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:61 0ee16fb7ae884f9c8830dd7b2fb8630a
msgid ""
"**调用时机**：必须第一个调用，``build`` 会校验 ``_training_config is not None``，否则抛出 "
"``ValueError``。"
msgstr ""
"**Call timing**: must be called first; ``build`` validates that "
"``_training_config is not None``, otherwise it raises ``ValueError``."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:65 05e044397c7647bcbef44d41393c7b16
msgid "with_data —— 数据配置"
msgstr "with_data — Data configuration"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:80 3a0856a4f5bd41aeb1f5874421ff0ad4
msgid ""
"创建 ``DataConfig``。内部 ``_setup_data_loaders`` 会自动将传入的 ``Dataset`` 包装为优化过的 "
"``DataLoader``（使用 ``create_optimized_dataloader``，启用 "
"``pin_memory``、``prefetch_factor=2``、``persistent_workers``）；如果传入的已经是 "
"``DataLoader`` 实例，则原样使用不做二次包装。"
msgstr ""
"Creates a ``DataConfig``. Internally, ``_setup_data_loaders`` automatically "
"wraps the passed ``Dataset`` into an optimized ``DataLoader`` (via "
"``create_optimized_dataloader`` with ``pin_memory``, ``prefetch_factor=2``, "
"and ``persistent_workers`` enabled); if a ``DataLoader`` instance is already "
"passed, it is used as-is without double wrapping."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:84 309c143c237349d9bec869972f1ccc3b
msgid "with_optimization —— 优化配置"
msgstr "with_optimization — Optimization configuration"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:97 c54753cd9b164d3f807558ae96431b9e
msgid ""
"创建 ``OptimizationConfig``。其中 ``early_stopping`` 接收 "
"``EarlyStoppingConfig`` dataclass（定义 "
"``monitor``、``mode``、``patience``、``min_delta``），``build`` 阶段内部会据此构造 "
"``EarlyStopping`` 工具实例。"
msgstr ""
"Creates an ``OptimizationConfig``. The ``early_stopping`` field accepts an "
"``EarlyStoppingConfig`` dataclass (defining ``monitor``, ``mode``, "
"``patience``, ``min_delta``); during ``build`` an ``EarlyStopping`` utility "
"instance is constructed from it."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:99 d06e3a4fa4214557bb9b358608eb4895
msgid ""
"``max_clip_grad_norm`` 用于梯度裁剪，在 ``_run_train_batch`` 中 ``loss.backward`` "
"之后、``opt.step`` 之前执行："
msgstr ""
"``max_clip_grad_norm`` is used for gradient clipping, executed in "
"``_run_train_batch`` after ``loss.backward`` and before ``opt.step``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:110 c97f7c47dbe34538b5e16387aca8bb5e
msgid "with_experiment —— 实验管理"
msgstr "with_experiment — Experiment management"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:125 ade09dfc9b5a4d7784ad18188ec2050c
msgid "创建 ``ExperimentConfig``，负责日志目录、超参数保存和指标记录后端。关键行为："
msgstr ""
"Creates an ``ExperimentConfig`` responsible for the log directory, "
"hyperparameter persistence, and metric logging backends. Key behaviors:"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:127 8482bbb61f424e4d8fc3797a0f4323df
msgid ""
"``no_swanlab`` 和 ``log_batch_metrics`` 支持双通道解析：显式传入优先，否则回退到 "
"``hyperparams``（CLI 参数）中的对应字段。这意味着 ``--no_swanlab`` / "
"``--log_batch_metrics`` 命令行标志对所有模型生效。"
msgstr ""
"``no_swanlab`` and ``log_batch_metrics`` support dual-channel resolution: "
"explicit values take precedence, otherwise they fall back to the "
"corresponding fields in ``hyperparams`` (CLI arguments). This means the "
"``--no_swanlab`` / ``--log_batch_metrics`` CLI flags work for all models."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:128 bc8c67fdbeb04f3e954d140760c22d21
msgid "本地 CSV 记录始终启用，SwanLab 仅在未设置 ``--no_swanlab`` 时启动。"
msgstr ""
"Local CSV logging is always enabled; SwanLab starts only when ``--no_swanlab`` "
"is not set."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:129 1aa00e9b70fa49f6b5d0c100f7dbaffd
msgid "``skip_test`` 控制训练完成后的测试集评估。"
msgstr "``skip_test`` controls test set evaluation after training completes."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:133 21e2d296177344c9960e9f21e321ae8f
msgid "build —— 装配与校验"
msgstr "build — Assembly and validation"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:135 85b98b986e7f41ca9c0f74425cd7f9b6
msgid "``build`` 按 12 个步骤顺序执行初始化："
msgstr "``build`` performs initialization in 12 sequential steps:"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:137 5e778c47f80945af8652ae538b790ed5
msgid ""
"**校验**：四个配置对象（training / data / optimization / experiment）必须都已调用，否则抛 "
"``ValueError``"
msgstr ""
"**Validation**: all four config objects (training / data / optimization / "
"experiment) must have been set, otherwise a ``ValueError`` is raised"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:138 7f7e614b8d964cd2b915bd131c558c40
msgid "**设备**：自动检测或使用显式指定的设备"
msgstr "**Device**: auto-detect or use the explicitly specified device"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:139 6cabe9784fb24d23b5be0e60e620610a
msgid ""
"**日志开关**：调用 ``resolve_metric_logging_flags`` 解析 ``no_swanlab`` / "
"``log_batch_metrics``（显式 > CLI）"
msgstr ""
"**Logging flags**: calls ``resolve_metric_logging_flags`` to resolve "
"``no_swanlab`` / ``log_batch_metrics`` (explicit > CLI)"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:140 80e7889ad9cd4a309e487a21a98ce83d
msgid ""
"**随机种子**：调用 ``seed_everything(seed, deterministic)``，同时设置 PyTorch / NumPy"
" / Python random 种子"
msgstr ""
"**Random seed**: calls ``seed_everything(seed, deterministic)``, setting the "
"PyTorch / NumPy / Python random seeds together"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:141 bb25db3da81d448db4963e41afcd1835
msgid "**DataLoader**：``_setup_data_loaders`` 包装 Dataset → DataLoader"
msgstr "**DataLoader**: ``_setup_data_loaders`` wraps Dataset → DataLoader"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:142 dd2d856fe8314363b00b92a815d69ed6
msgid "**优化器/损失/调度器/梯度裁剪**：从 ``OptimizationConfig`` 解包挂到实例属性"
msgstr ""
"**Optimizer/loss/scheduler/gradient clipping**: unpacked from "
"``OptimizationConfig`` and attached to instance attributes"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:143 474bcf37b11e4046b0aae3c84975b058
msgid "**早停**：``EarlyStoppingConfig → EarlyStopping`` 实例化"
msgstr "**Early stopping**: ``EarlyStoppingConfig → EarlyStopping`` instantiation"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:144 323409cdf8ee47a9a13a88c515d5320b
msgid "**日志目录**：``exp_manager.get_log_dir`` 创建 ``runs/<type>/<name>/``"
msgstr "**Log directory**: ``exp_manager.get_log_dir`` creates ``runs/<type>/<name>/``"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:145 5d5879c328254fcaaa14fe2addd9121d
msgid "**组件初始化**：``MetricsAccumulator``、``CheckpointManager``、``MetricLogger``、``CallbackManager``"
msgstr ""
"**Component initialization**: ``MetricsAccumulator``, ``CheckpointManager``, "
"``MetricLogger``, ``CallbackManager``"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:146 48320fc052d54fe693cb596aff0d32b7
msgid "**超参数保存**：调用 ``HyperparameterManager`` 保存模型参数量、优化器、损失函数、设备信息等元数据"
msgstr ""
"**Hyperparameter persistence**: calls ``HyperparameterManager`` to save "
"metadata such as model parameter count, optimizer, loss function, and device "
"info"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:147 c90285b314f7464b9a9c66416853f867
msgid "**检查点恢复**：若指定了 ``checkpoint_path``，加载模型权重和训练状态"
msgstr ""
"**Checkpoint restoration**: if ``checkpoint_path`` is specified, loads the "
"model weights and training state"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:148 2051427510204b089ac702f9855d16b0
msgid "**torch.compile**：若通过 ``with_compile`` 或 CLI 参数启用了编译优化"
msgstr ""
"**torch.compile**: if compilation optimization was enabled via "
"``with_compile`` or a CLI argument"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:150 74122145f2814407a1f25e826f0e787c
msgid ".."
msgstr ".."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:152 0d51904e7ed94d86a45eafd3d69c0524
msgid ""
"**重要**：``build`` 必须显式调用。``run`` 检查 ``self._built`` 标志，若未构建直接抛出 "
"``RuntimeError``。重复调用 ``build`` 会被跳过并记录警告。"
msgstr ""
"**Important**: ``build`` must be called explicitly. ``run`` checks the "
"``self._built`` flag and raises ``RuntimeError`` if it has not been built. "
"Repeated calls to ``build`` are skipped with a warning."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:154 c024e9993dec4b69b155ed78de144268
msgid "回调系统"
msgstr "Callback system"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:156 8f098300da3a4bd68dfeba7a9f27de00
