#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:7 e204ccc18f2742eaa7f9aef5f297763c
msgid "模型原始输出（logits），未经过阈值处理或 sigmoid"
msgstr "Raw model output (logits), without thresholding or sigmoid"

