msgid "``y_label``"
msgstr "``y_label``"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:7 3b0c72f5089b4464919bda10e416ebba
msgid "真实标签，float 类型"
msgstr "Ground-truth labels, float type"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:7 7a6072c4710e43a39da5a9f519b4b192
msgid "``y_predict``"
msgstr "``y_predict``"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:7 4b41a645c8d64ae49ced55f2ac4db8cc
msgid ""
"二值预测结果（0/1），int 类型。由 ``_generate_binary_predictions`` 默认使用 threshold=0.0 "
"生成"
msgstr ""
"Binary predictions (0/1), int type. Generated by "
"``_generate_binary_predictions`` with threshold=0.0 by default"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:192 1da170e5c36a40d1a652a668ebcdb0a5
msgid ""
"训练和验证阶段均调用 ``forward_pass``。测试评估默认调用 ``test_forward_pass``，它默认转发到 "
"``forward_pass``，子类可重写以在测试时使用不同逻辑（如加载集成模型）。"
msgstr ""
"Both training and validation phases call ``forward_pass``. Test evaluation "
"calls ``test_forward_pass`` by default, which forwards to ``forward_pass``; "
"subclasses can override it to use different logic at test time (e.g. loading "
"an ensemble model)."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:194 c6094ed8e7c34e6cbe42af426f1a7f20
msgid "``_compute_loss`` 从 outputs 字典取出 ``y_hat`` 和 ``y_label`` 计算损失："
msgstr ""
"``_compute_loss`` extracts ``y_hat`` and ``y_label`` from the outputs dict to "
"compute the loss:"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:203 bd4b2e2521d146948818e1f7f2055d07
msgid "子类如有自定义损失逻辑（如多任务损失、正则化项），可重写 ``_compute_loss``。"
msgstr ""
"Subclasses with custom loss logic (e.g. multi-task losses, regularization "
"terms) can override ``_compute_loss``."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:205 e0c1d4f733fc4c9b97116ccd06a50788
msgid "训练循环中的调用流"
msgstr "Call flow within the training loop"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:223 484ad8198151492c814727f35550fd9f
msgid "数据对齐与预测位提取"
msgstr "Data alignment and prediction extraction"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:225 383de785fc9b4588a693370577ed4413
msgid "知识追踪任务的核心约定是 **next-item 预测**：用前 t 个交互预测第 t+1 个交互的答题正确性。如果对齐出错，会导致评估指标虚高。"
msgstr ""
"The core convention of knowledge tracing tasks is **next-item prediction**: "
"use the first t interactions to predict the correctness of the (t+1)-th "
"interaction. Misalignment inflates the evaluation metrics."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:229 0dd7ef5723ed4dbc83d1fa0942835f0b
msgid "\\_extract_valid_predictions"
msgstr "\\_extract_valid_predictions"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:231 6fc32bdfcc9c41b19f976ece5c52c04c
msgid "BaseTrainer 提供了静态方法 ``_extract_valid_predictions`` 来正确处理对齐："
msgstr ""
"BaseTrainer provides the static method ``_extract_valid_predictions`` to "
"handle alignment correctly:"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:243 3cb5103841944dfba49e23248d256c0c
msgid "**核心逻辑**："
msgstr "**Core logic**:"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:245 c1c40463f35b4307abd16093274d787b
msgid ""
"**next-item 对齐**：取 ``y_hat_full[:, :-1]`` 作为预测，配 ``response[:, 1:]`` "
"作为标签。即 t 时刻的模型输出用于预测 t+1 时刻的答题结果。"
msgstr ""
"**next-item alignment**: take ``y_hat_full[:, :-1]`` as predictions paired "
"with ``response[:, 1:]`` as labels. That is, the model output at time t is "
"used to predict the response at time t+1."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:246 6a02cfeccad741848ae3b8515ba7f0d8
msgid ""
"**掩码交叉校验**：只保留 ``mask[:, :-1] & mask[:, 1:]`` "
"的位置——即当前位置和下一位置都有效的交互对。这确保不会在序列边界或填充位置提取无意义的预测。"
msgstr ""
"**Mask cross-check**: keep only positions where ``mask[:, :-1] & mask[:, "
"1:]`` — i.e. interaction pairs valid at both the current and the next "
"position. This ensures no meaningless predictions are extracted at sequence "
"boundaries or padding positions."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:247 546ae93fc3ad440e8ef13252a6757baa
msgid ""
"**same_position 归一化**：部分模型（如输出长度为 S-1 的架构）输出的是同位置约定 ``out[t] → "
"response[t]``。设置 ``same_position=True`` 会将 ``y_hat_full[:, 1:]`` "
"左移一位并在末尾补零占位，统一转换为 next-item 视图后再对齐。"
msgstr ""
"**same_position normalization**: some models (e.g. architectures with output "
"length S-1) follow a same-position convention ``out[t] → response[t]``. "
"Setting ``same_position=True`` shifts ``y_hat_full[:, 1:]`` left by one and "
"pads a zero column at the end, converting it into a next-item view before "
"alignment."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:249 7efbe2caceee4538ba26bf20ae06640c
msgid "**为什么需要预测位提取？**"
msgstr "**Why is prediction extraction needed?**"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:251 114d4bed43e1470d9841a4a161adf465
msgid ""
"假设序列 ``[q1, q2, q3, q4]`` 对应答案 ``[r1, r2, r3, r4]``。如果直接计算 ``y_hat[t]`` 与"
" ``response[t]`` 的匹配（同位置），模型在预测 ``q3`` 的结果时可能\"看到\"了 ``q3`` 本身的信息。正确的做法是用"
" ``y_hat[:3]`` 与 ``response[1:4]`` 配对——模型看到前 t 个题，预测第 t+1 个题的答案。"
msgstr ""
"Suppose the sequence ``[q1, q2, q3, q4]`` corresponds to answers ``[r1, r2, "
"r3, r4]``. If you directly match ``y_hat[t]`` with ``response[t]`` (same "
"position), the model may have \"seen\" information about ``q3`` itself when "
"predicting the outcome of ``q3``. The correct approach is to pair "
"``y_hat[:3]`` with ``response[1:4]`` — the model sees the first t questions "
"and predicts the answer to the (t+1)-th question."

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:255 61534a5358a54007b0fc1eb3c103ac8b
msgid "\\_pad_to_full_sequence"
msgstr "\\_pad_to_full_sequence"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:257 bba8636fb45744d8a5207da2743146b2
msgid ""
"部分模型（如 GKT、SAKT、SGKT、MIKT、KQN）的 next-item 输出长度为 "
"``S-1``（因为最后一个时间步没有下一项可预测）。``_pad_to_full_sequence`` 在时间维末尾补一列零占位，将 ``[B,"
" S-1]`` 扩展为 ``[B, S]``，使得 ``_extract_valid_predictions`` 的 ``[:, :-1]`` "
"切片能正确丢弃这一占位列："
msgstr ""
"Some models (e.g. GKT, SAKT, SGKT, MIKT, KQN) produce next-item outputs of "
"length ``S-1`` (because the last time step has no next item to predict). "
"``_pad_to_full_sequence`` pads a zero column at the end of the time "
"dimension, expanding ``[B, S-1]`` to ``[B, S]`` so that the ``[:, :-1]`` "
"slice in ``_extract_valid_predictions`` correctly drops this placeholder "
"column:"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:267 09fb291eed7140e7ba546926b19d5c6a
msgid "\\_handle_empty_batch"
msgstr "\\_handle_empty_batch"

#: ../../source/advanced/trainer.md:269 8b8d40609923462aba3b95e45ca599bd
msgid ""
"当批次内所有位置都被掩码过滤掉时（例如序列长度不足或采样策略排除），``y_label.numel == 0`` 会触发 "
"``ValueError`` 并给出详细的排查提示："
msgstr ""
"When every position in a batch is filtered out by the mask (e.g. due to "
"insufficient sequence length or sampling strategy exclusion), "
"``y_label.numel == 0`` triggers a ``ValueError`` with a detailed diagnostic "
"hint:"

